        "why_choose_eG9giy": {
          "type": "why_choose",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Health Benefits of Hot Tea with Every Sip of SPORTea®",
            "content": "<h3><strong>1. Boosts Immunity and Fights Illness</strong></h3><p>Drinking hot tea is a time-honored remedy for immune support, and with SPORTea®, you get an added boost from powerful natural ingredients:</p><ul><li><strong>🍊Vitamin C:</strong> A key immunity booster that helps your body fight off colds and flu.</li><li>🌿<strong>Ginger:</strong> Known for its anti-inflammatory properties, ginger is excellent for relieving sore throats and clearing sinuses.</li><li><strong>💪Siberian Ginseng:</strong> An adaptogen that helps your body resist stress and boosts immune function.</li></ul><p></p><h3><strong><br/>2. Provides Sustained Energy Without Jitters</strong></h3><p>Unlike sugary energy drinks or coffee, <strong>hot SPORTea®</strong>provides a steady, balanced boost of energy without a crash:</p><ul><li><strong>🍃Green Tea & Black Tea:</strong> Provide natural, mild caffeine for focus and clarity.</li><li>🌿<strong>Brazilian Maté:</strong> A natural energy booster loaded with nutrients and antioxidants.</li><li><strong>💪Siberian Ginseng:</strong> Enhances stamina and reduces fatigue.</li></ul><p></p><h3><strong><br/>3. Supports Digestive Health and Reduces Inflammation</strong></h3><p>The warmth of <strong>hot tea </strong>is known for aiding digestion, and SPORTea® takes it a step further:</p><ul><li>🌿<strong>Ginger:</strong> Soothes the stomach, reduces nausea, and aids digestion.</li><li><strong>☕Green Tea:</strong> Supports a healthy metabolism and promotes gut health.</li></ul><p></p><h3><strong><br/>4. Promotes Relaxation and Reduces Stress</strong></h3><p>Enjoying a cup of <strong>hot tea </strong>isn’t just about flavor—it’s about self-care and relaxation:</p><ul><li><strong>🍃L-theanine in Green Tea:</strong> Promotes relaxation without drowsiness.</li><li>🌿<strong>Ginger & Ginseng:</strong> Help reduce cortisol levels and calm the mind.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "why_choose_ihqeXa": {
          "type": "why_choose",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Types of Tea in Hot SPORTea® and Their Unique Benefits",
            "content": "<h3><strong>1. Green Tea: Antioxidant Powerhouse</strong></h3><p>Green tea is known for its numerous health benefits:</p><ul><li><strong>✅</strong>Rich in catechins that fight cell damage.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Boosts metabolism and aids weight management.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Supports brain function and mental clarity.</li></ul><h3><br/></h3><h3><strong>2. Black Tea: Heart-Healthy and Energizing</strong></h3><p>Black tea adds a robust flavor to SPORTea® and is packed with benefits:</p><ul><li><strong>✅</strong>Supports heart health by lowering bad cholesterol.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Enhances focus and alertness.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Contains antioxidants that help reduce inflammation.</li></ul><h3><br/></h3><h3><strong>3. Brazilian Maté: The Energizing Superleaf </strong></h3><p>A unique addition to SPORTea®, Brazilian maté offers:</p><ul><li><strong>✅</strong>Natural energy without the jitters.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Rich in vitamins and minerals.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Supports metabolism and helps suppress appetite.</li></ul><h3><br/></h3><h3><strong>4. Siberian Ginseng: The Endurance Booster</strong></h3><p>An essential adaptogen for wellness and stamina:</p><ul><li><strong>✅</strong>Enhances physical performance.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Supports immunity and reduces stress.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Provides a natural, sustained energy boost.</li></ul><p><br/></p><h3><strong>5. Ginger: Nature’s Healing Root </strong></h3><p>Ginger is a key player in SPORTea®’s hot blend:</p><ul><li><strong>✅</strong>Reduces inflammation and relieves muscle soreness.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Supports digestion and gut health.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Warms the body and promotes circulation.</li></ul><h3><br/></h3><h3><strong>6. Vitamin C: Immune Support Superstar<br/></strong></h3><p>Essential for health and wellness:</p><ul><li><strong>✅</strong>Strengthens the immune system.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Promotes skin health and wound healing.</li><li><strong>✅</strong>Fights free radicals with antioxidant power.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
